  (text "Copied from the Tiny Tapeout demo board v3 RP2350B sheet. GPIO map (unchanged, so the TT firmware runs as is):\nGPIO0 ctrl_ena, GPIO1 ctrl_sel_rst_n, GPIO2 ctrl_sel_inc, GPIO3-10 management (breakout ID EEPROM on GPIO4/5),\nGPIO11 LED, GPIO14 project reset, GPIO16 project clock, GPIO17-24 ui_in, GPIO25-32 uio, GPIO33-40 uo_out.\nNew: GPIO12/13 I2C to the INA228 power monitor, GPIO15 its ALERT."
